  "title": "Subscription renewal through Apple not recognized",
  "summary": "Hi, I originally purchased a yearly premium subscription to NewsBlur on my iPhone/iPad in 2023. This worked fine and renewed without issue in 2024, and 2025. This year, I saw the renewal payments go through, but today I got a notice that my premium account had expired. I have confirmed again that the payment for the renewal was made through Apple account payment history, and my bank. Please assist or let me know what other information I can provide to restore the account status. Thanks, akdb ...",
